# Unicode CLDR, locale ta, dateFields.json, field week.
# A counted noun is CASE-MARKED in Tamil, not bare: the ago pattern is
# the DATIVE unit plus முன், and the in-N pattern is the LOCATIVE on
# the unit with no preposition at all.  Both case forms are unit
# surfaces in their own right, and both are CLDR's own wording.
வாரம்
வாரங்கள்
வாரத்திற்கு
வாரங்களுக்கு
